===Noun===
{{en-noun|-}}

# {{l|en|The [[fear]] of [[fear]]; the fear of developing a [[phobia]].}}
#* {{quote-journal|en|author=Heather Hatfield|title=The Fear Factor: Phobias|magazine=w:WebMD|url=https://www.webmd.com/anxiety-panic/features/fear-factor-phobias|date=2004-07-26|passage=When Franklin Delano Roosevelt said, "The only thing we have to fear is fear itself," he was describing '''phobophobia''' -- the fear of being afraid.}}
#* {{quote-text|en|year=2014|author=w:Adrian Vermeule|title=The Constitution of Risk
|passage=In particular, the rulemakers – here judges who craft free speech doctrine – may themselves display a pathological fear of succumbing to pathological fear, a kind of '''phobophobia'''.}}
